From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: USA-RedDragon <USA-RedDragon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:00:03 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(process): hand background processes to the next gateway

terminal.process_handoff_backends ([] = off): a graceful restart hands
background processes of the listed backends to the next gateway, which
reattaches them from processes.json with the same session id, output
and completion routing. Plugins register reattach providers for their
own processes. An env poll that gets no exit status (a backend that is
reconnecting) is retried instead of read as an exit.
